'''Ankou''' are skeletal, ghostly monsters. Ankou in the fourth level of the [[Stronghold of Security]] can drop the [[left skull half]], one of four parts of the [[skull sceptre]].

Ankou are popular monsters for their common [[death rune|death]] and [[blood rune]] drops, and in the [[Wilderness]] they are an excellent source of [[dark fishing bait]]. They can be assigned as Slayer tasks by [[Vannaka]], [[Nieve]]/[[Steve]], [[Krystilia]], [[Duradel]]/[[Kuradal]], and [[Konar quo Maten]].

